---
// Astro Page Component - Arnab Chakraborty Complete Lookbook Portfolio
---

<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<title>Arnab Chakraborty — Inventor, Founder & Systems Architect</title>
		<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400;1,600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;1,300&family=Space+Mono:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
		<style>
			@keyframes marquee {
				0% { transform: translateX(0%); }
				100% { transform: translateX(-50%); }
			}
			.animate-marquee {
				display: flex;
				width: 200%;
				animation: marquee 28s linear infinite;
			}
			.animate-marquee:hover {
				animation-play-state: paused;
			}
			.bg-canvas {
				background-color: #080807;
			}
			.bg-lookbook-grid {
				background-size: 100px 100px;
				background-image: 
					linear-gradient(to right, rgba(229, 226, 220, 0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
					linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(229, 226, 220, 0.025) 1px, transparent 1px);
			}
			.titanium-glass {
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
				backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(180%);
				-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(180%);
				border: 1px solid rgba(229, 226, 220, 0.1);
				box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15), 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
			}
			.titanium-glass:hover {
				border-color: rgba(229, 226, 220, 0.28);
				box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25), 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
			}
			.font-serif-editorial {
				font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
			}
			.font-mono-tech {
				font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
			}
			.img-grayscale-hover {
				filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(110%);
				transition: filter 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
			}
			.group:hover .img-grayscale-hover {
				filter: grayscale(0%) contrast(100%);
				transform: scale(1.04);
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body class="bg-canvas text-[#E5E2DC] font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans'] antialiased selection:bg-[#E5E2DC] selection:text-black overflow-x-hidden">

		<!-- Environmental Background Overlay -->
		<div class="fixed inset-0 bg-lookbook-grid pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-100"></div>
		<div class="fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0">
			<div class="absolute top-[-10%] left-[20%] w-[600px] h-[600px] rounded-full bg-white/[0.02] blur-[150px]"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-[-10%] right-[10%] w-[700px] h-[700px] rounded-full bg-amber-500/[0.015] blur-[180px]"></div>
		</div>

		<!-- Navigation Dock -->
		<nav class="fixed top-0 left-0 w-full z-50 px-4 sm:px-8 py-6">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto titanium-glass rounded-full px-6 py-3.5 flex items-center justify-between">
				<a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-3 group">
					<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#E5E2DC] group-hover:scale-150 transition-all duration-300"></span>
					<span class="font-bold text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-mono-tech text-white">ARNAB CHAKRABORTY</span>
				</a>
				
				<div class="hidden lg:flex items-center gap-8 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] font-mono-tech text-zinc-400">
					<a href="#manifesto" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">01. ORIGINS</a>
					<a href="#exhibition" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">02. PORTFOLIO</a>
					<a href="#distinction" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">03. CREDENTIALS</a>
					<a href="#culture" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">04. CULTURE & PASSIONS</a>
					<a href="#forecasts" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">05. FORESIGHT</a>
				</div>

				<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
					<a href="#contact" class="px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-[#E5E2DC] text-black font-semibold text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase font-mono-tech hover:bg-white transition-all">
						Direct Engagement
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<section class="relative z-10 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center pt-36 pb-20 px-6">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
				
				<!-- Left Text Column -->
				<div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-8 text-center lg:text-left">
					<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full titanium-glass text-[11px] font-mono-tech text-zinc-300 border border-white/10">
						<span class="flex items-center gap-2">
							<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
							<span class="text-white">ATLANTA // GA</span>
						</span>
						<span class="text-zinc-600">|</span>
						<span>GT BME '13</span>
						<span class="text-zinc-600">|</span>
						<span>2X 40 UNDER 40</span>
						<span class="text-zinc-600">|</span>
						<span>TOP 40 LAA INVENTOR</span>
					</div>

					<h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-light tracking-tight leading-[0.92] text-white">
						From Sketches <br>
						<span class="font-serif-editorial italic font-normal text-[#E5E2DC] opacity-90">
							to Systemic Solutions.
						</span>
					</h1>

					<p class="max-w-xl text-zinc-400 text-base sm:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed tracking-wide">
						GT Biomedical Engineer, patented cardiovascular device inventor, and multi-industry leader operating across MedTech, healthcare product strategy, architectural apparel, and venture networks.
					</p>

					<div class="pt-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center lg:justify-start items-center font-mono-tech text-xs">
						<a href="#exhibition" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-[#E5E2DC] text-black font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase hover:bg-white transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-3 shadow-2xl">
							EXPLORE PORTFOLIO MATRIX
							<span>↓</span>
						</a>
						<a href="#culture" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-full titanium-glass text-zinc-300 font-medium tracking-[0.15em] uppercase hover:text-white transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
							CULTURE & PASSIONS
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Right Editorial Image Anchor Frame -->
				<div class="lg:col-span-5 relative group">
					<div class="titanium-glass rounded-3xl p-3 border border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
						<div class="relative h-[480px] sm:h-[560px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-zinc-900">
							<img 
								src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509631179647-0177331693ae?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" 
								alt="Arnab Chakraborty Studio Portrait" 
								class="w-full h-full object-cover img-grayscale-hover"
							/>
							<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
							
							<div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 font-mono-tech text-xs flex justify-between items-end text-zinc-300">
								<div>
									<p class="text-white font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">FIGURE 01 // FOUNDER PORTRAIT</p>
									<p class="text-[10px] text-zinc-400 mt-1">ATLANTA STUDIO CANVAS</p>
								</div>
								<span class="text-[10px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-black/60 border border-white/20">2026</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Archival Marquee Ticker -->
		<div class="relative z-10 py-5 border-y border-white/10 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-md overflow-hidden">
			<div class="animate-marquee whitespace-nowrap flex items-center gap-12 font-mono-tech text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] text-zinc-500 uppercase">
				<span>FLOW MEDTECH // CARDIOVASCULAR IMPLANTS</span>
				<span class="text-[#E5E2DC]">✦</span>
				<span>AWOKEN MATTER // ATEHLIYE DESIGN HOUSE</span>
				<span class="text-[#E5E2DC]">✦</span>
				<span>TOP 40 LAA INVENTOR</span>
				<span class="text-[#E5E2DC]">✦</span>
				<span>RIVER HEALTH // HEALTHCARE STRATEGY</span>
				<span class="text-[#E5E2DC]">✦</span>
				<span>FOUNDERS FORGE // 26+ STARTUPS</span>
				<span class="text-[#E5E2DC]">✦</span>
				<span>GEORGIA TECH 40 UNDER 40</span>
				<span class="text-[#E5E2DC]">✦</span>
				<span>DELOITTE CORTEX // ENTERPRISE SYSTEMS</span>
				<span class="text-[#E5E2DC]">✦</span>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Origins & Personal Narrative Section -->
		<section id="manifesto" class="relative z-10 py-32 px-6">
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto titanium-glass rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-16 relative overflow-hidden">
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start">
					<div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-3">
						<span class="font-mono-tech text-xs text-zinc-400 tracking-[0.25em] uppercase">// 01. ORIGINS & PHILOSOPHY</span>
						<h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-light leading-tight text-white font-serif-editorial">
							Building with <br><span class="italic text-[#E5E2DC]">purpose & intent.</span>
						</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-6 text-zinc-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-light">
						<p>
							My journey into innovation wasn't sparked solely in a conventional lab—it began with a skateboard, a group of creative friends, and a drive to build something meaningful from scratch. With roots stretching from India to Oklahoma, Northeast Tennessee, and Atlanta, Georgia, I learned early on that true creativity merges technical rigor with authentic expression.
						</p>
						<p>
							Encouraged by my family to dream with purpose and leave the world better than I found it, I pursued Biomedical Engineering at Georgia Tech (Class of 2013). That path led to co-founding <strong class="text-white font-normal">Flow MedTech</strong>, where we engineered polymer heart implants to eliminate stroke risk in AFib patients—earning multiple patents and recognition as a Top 40 global LAA inventor.
						</p>
						<p>
							Today, I apply that same engineering discipline to luxury physical apparel with <strong class="text-white font-normal">Awoken Matter</strong> under design house <em>Atehliye</em>, while leading healthcare product strategy at <strong class="text-white font-normal">River Health</strong>, building venture ecosystems at <strong class="text-white font-normal">Founders Forge</strong>, and advising emerging startups.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Visual Portfolio Exhibition Matrix -->
		<section id="exhibition" class="relative z-10 py-24 px-6">
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-12">
				<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
					<div>
						<span class="font-mono-tech text-xs text-zinc-400 tracking-[0.25em] uppercase">// 02. VENTURE MATRIX</span>
						<h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-light mt-2 text-white font-serif-editorial">The Portfolio</h2>
					</div>
					<p class="text-zinc-400 text-xs font-mono-tech tracking-widest uppercase">
						MEDTECH • HEALTHCARE • APPAREL • ECOSYSTEMS
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Bento Grid with Photos -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
					
					<!-- Card 1: Flow MedTech (8 cols) -->
					<div class="md:col-span-8 titanium-glass rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8 group">
						<div class="space-y-6">
							<div class="relative h-64 sm:h-80 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-black/60 border border-white/10">
								<img 
									src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160399-112ba8d25d1d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" 
									alt="Flow MedTech Cardiovascular R&D" 
									class="w-full h-full object-cover img-grayscale-hover"
								/>
								<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
								<span class="absolute top-4 left-4 font-mono-tech text-[10px] px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-black/60 border border-white/20 text-white">
									STRUCTURAL HEART R&D
								</span>
							</div>

							<div class="space-y-3">
								<div class="flex justify-between items-start">
									<span class="font-mono-tech text-xs text-zinc-400 tracking-widest uppercase">CATALOG 001 // MEDTECH IMPLANTS</span>
									<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white text-[10px] font-mono-tech">Co-Founder & CTO</span>
								</div>
								<h3 class="text-3xl font-light text-white font-serif-editorial group-hover:text-zinc-200 transition-colors">Flow MedTech</h3>
								<p class="text-zinc-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-light">
									Co-founded and led Chief Technology Officer operations for polymer-based Left Atrial Appendage (LAA) occlusion heart implants to eliminate stroke risk in AFib patients without long-term blood thinners. Conducted clinical research across 100+ clinicians. Client company of the Cleveland Clinic Global Cardiovascular Innovation Center (GCIC).
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono-tech text-xs text-zinc-400">
							<span>TOP 40 LAA INVENTOR • MULTIPLE PATENTS</span>
							<span class="text-white group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">EXPLORE MEDTECH →</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Card 2: 2x 40 Under 40 Distinction (4 cols) -->
					<div class="md:col-span-4 titanium-glass rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.03] to-black/90">
						<div class="space-y-4">
							<div class="relative h-48 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-black/60 border border-white/10">
								<img 
									src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507679799987-c73779587ccf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" 
									alt="Georgia Tech Honor" 
									class="w-full h-full object-cover img-grayscale-hover"
								/>
							</div>
							<span class="font-mono-tech text-xs text-amber-300 tracking-widest uppercase">HONOR & ACCOLADE</span>
							<h4 class="text-3xl font-light text-white font-serif-editorial">2x 40 Under 40 Honoree</h4>
							<p class="text-zinc-400 text-xs leading-relaxed font-light">
								Awarded by Georgia Tech (2020) and Tri-Cities Business Journal (2021) for inventing cardiovascular stroke-prevention devices and leading multi-industry ventures.
							</p>
						</div>
						<div class="pt-4 border-t border-white/10 font-mono-tech text-[10px] text-amber-200 uppercase tracking-widest">
							GEORGIA TECH & TRI-CITIES
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Card 3: Awoken Matter (6 cols) -->
					<div class="md:col-span-6 titanium-glass rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8 group">
						<div class="space-y-6">
							<div class="relative h-64 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-black/60 border border-white/10">
								<img 
									src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515886657613-9f3515b0c78f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" 
									alt="Awoken Matter Architectural Apparel" 
									class="w-full h-full object-cover img-grayscale-hover"
								/>
								<span class="absolute top-4 left-4 font-mono-tech text-[10px] px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-black/60 border border-white/20 text-white">
									ARCHITECTURAL APPAREL
								</span>
							</div>

							<div class="space-y-3">
								<div class="flex justify-between items-start">
									<span class="font-mono-tech text-xs text-zinc-400 tracking-widest uppercase">CATALOG 002 // PHYSICAL DESIGN</span>
									<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white text-[10px] font-mono-tech">Co-Founder</span>
								</div>
								<h3 class="text-3xl font-light text-white font-serif-editorial group-hover:text-zinc-200 transition-colors">Awoken Matter</h3>
								<p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light">
									Luxury architectural streetwear and physical design studio under design house <em>Atehliye</em>. Fusing 450GSM heavyweight fabrications, Renaissance canvas overlays, and structural rigor to treat clothing as personal armor.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex justify-between items-center font-mono-tech text-xs text-zinc-400">
							<span>ATEHLIYE DESIGN HOUSE</span>
							<span class="text-white group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">EXPLORE STUDIO →</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Card 4: River Health (6 cols) -->
					<div class="md:col-span-6 titanium-glass rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8 group">
						<div class="space-y-6">
							<div class="relative h-64 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-black/60 border border-white/10">
								<img 
									src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504868584819-f8e8b4b6d7e3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" 
									alt="River Health Product Strategy" 
									class="w-full h-full object-cover img-grayscale-hover"
								/>
								<span class="absolute top-4 left-4 font-mono-tech text-[10px] px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-black/60 border border-white/20 text-white">
									HEALTHCARE STRATEGY
								</span>
							</div>

							<div class="space-y-3">
								<div class="flex justify-between items-start">
									<span class="font-mono-tech text-xs text-emerald-400 tracking-widest uppercase">CATALOG 003 // HEALTHCARE STRATEGY</span>
									<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 text-[10px] font-mono-tech">Product | Strategy</span>
								</div>
								<h3 class="text-3xl font-light text-white font-serif-editorial group-hover:text-emerald-200 transition-colors">River Health</h3>
								<p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light">
									Directing end-to-end product development lifecycles from conception to launch. Driving data-informed decision making through key metric analysis, A/B testing, customer interviews, and strategic roadmap leadership.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex justify-between items-center font-mono-tech text-xs text-zinc-400">
							<span>HEALTHCARE INNOVATION</span>
							<span class="text-emerald-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">PRODUCT STRATEGY →</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Card 5: FoundersForge & Angel Roundtable (6 cols) -->
					<div class="md:col-span-6 titanium-glass rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8 group">
						<div class="space-y-6">
							<div class="relative h-56 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-black/60 border border-white/10">
								<img 
									src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531482615713-2afd69097998?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" 
									alt="FoundersForge Startup Ecosystem" 
									class="w-full h-full object-cover img-grayscale-hover"
								/>
							</div>

							<div class="space-y-3">
								<div class="flex justify-between items-start">
									<span class="font-mono-tech text-xs text-purple-400 tracking-widest uppercase">CATALOG 004 // VENTURE ECOSYSTEMS</span>
									<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 text-[10px] font-mono-tech">Co-Founder & EIR</span>
								</div>
								<h3 class="text-3xl font-light text-white font-serif-editorial group-hover:text-purple-200 transition-colors">FoundersForge</h3>
								<p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light">
									Co-founded in Johnson City, TN, cultivating a regional network connecting 26+ ventures and 45+ mentors. Served as Entrepreneur in Residence at The Angel Roundtable, guiding investment due diligence and venture screening.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex justify-between items-center font-mono-tech text-xs text-zinc-400">
							<span>26+ STARTUPS • 45+ MENTORS</span>
							<span class="text-purple-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">ECOSYSTEM IMPACT →</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Card 6: Deloitte Cortex (6 cols) -->
					<div class="md:col-span-6 titanium-glass rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8 group">
						<div class="space-y-6">
							<div class="relative h-56 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-black/60 border border-white/10">
								<img 
									src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" 
									alt="Deloitte Cortex Systems Operations" 
									class="w-full h-full object-cover img-grayscale-hover"
								/>
							</div>

							<div class="space-y-3">
								<div class="flex justify-between items-start">
									<span class="font-mono-tech text-xs text-blue-400 tracking-widest uppercase">CATALOG 005 // ENTERPRISE SYSTEMS</span>
									<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 text-blue-300 text-[10px] font-mono-tech">Product Delivery Lead</span>
								</div>
								<h3 class="text-3xl font-light text-white font-serif-editorial group-hover:text-blue-200 transition-colors">Deloitte (Cortex)</h3>
								<p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light">
									Managed large-scale data extraction and analytics tool rollouts within Audit & Assurance. Implemented vendor management strategies that boosted response times by 94% and maintained 95%+ Agile delivery success.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex justify-between items-center font-mono-tech text-xs text-zinc-400">
							<span>94% RESPONSE BOOST • 95%+ DELIVERY</span>
							<span class="text-blue-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">ENTERPRISE SYSTEMS →</span>
						</div>
					</div>

				</div>
